  "title": "Special handling for frames command's skip parameter, allow 0",
  "description": "When using the `frames` command to retrieve the packet list, the `skip` parameter must be a positive integer and cannot be 0. This behavior conflicts with the 0-based indexing convention commonly used in programming interfaces and was not explicitly documented.",
